      "message": "The code works like this.\n\n1. startCleanupUnknownHalTemplate is called()\n2. The first unknown user is deleted\n3. The HAL finishes removing the user\n4. InternalCleanupClient#onClientFinished() is called\n5. We get the next client that has not been removed\n6. We tell the hal to remove it\n7. We get another callback from the HAL for onFinished()\n8. The process will repeat.\n\nmUknownHalTemplates \u003d {0,1,2,3}\nStartCleanup() -\u003e { hal.remove(mUnknownHalTemplates.pop()) }\n\nonFinishedRemoving() -\u003e { if(mUnknownHalTemplates.size()) { StartCleanup })",
